# 🎂 Birthday Surprise Project 💖

This is a small web-based surprise created with love ❤️

## 💡 About

A personalized birthday surprise website that includes:

* 🔐 Password protection
* 💌 Emotional message
* 📸 Photo memories
* 🎵 Background music
* 🎥 Special video
* 💫 Smooth animations & slow reveal

## 🎁 Purpose

This project is created to make a special person feel happy and loved on their birthday.

## 📁 Project Structure

```
birthday-surprise/
│
├── index.html
├── README.md
├── photos/
├── songs/
└── videos/
```

## 🔑 How to Use

1. Open the website
2. Enter the password
3. Enjoy the surprise 💖

## 💖 Note

This project is made with pure intention and emotions.
Every detail is carefully designed to create a memorable moment.

